0 !FORAGE {"id":"ACH-Z03-S02","type":"scene","zone":"Z03","lines":"18.520–540","pieces":210,"subBuilds":20,"depth":2,"joints":64,"anchored":75,"held":135,"detached":0,"studs":[130,67],"height":{"ldu":788,"bricks":32.8,"plates":99},"cm":[104,53.6,31.5],"metals":{"gold":17,"silver":1,"bronze":79,"tin":26,"kyanos":44,"niello":13,"crimson":14,"flora":16},"status":"GREEN"}
0 !ACHILLES {"id":"ACH-Z03-S02","name":"Zone III · Scene 2: City at War — The River Ambush & Crimson Ker","zone":"Z03","lines":"18.520–540","greek":"οἱ δ᾽ ὅτε δή ῥ᾽ ἵκανον ὅθι σφίσιν εἶκε λοχῆσαι, ἐν ποταμῷ, ὅθι τ᾽ ἀρδμὸς ἔην πάντεσσι βοτοῖσιν, ἔνθ᾽ ἄρα τοί γ᾽ ἵζοντ᾽ εἰλυμένοι αἴθοπι χαλκῷ... ἐν δ᾽ Ἔρις ἐν δὲ Κυδοιμὸς ὁμίλεον, ἐν δ᾽ ὀλοὴ Κήρ, ἄλλον ζωὸν ἔχουσα νεούτατον, ἄλλον ἄουτον, ἄλλον τεθνηῶτα κατὰ μόθον ἕλκε ποδοῖϊν· εἷμα δ᾽ ἔχ᾽ ἀμφ᾽ ὤμοισι δαφοινεὸν αἵματι φωτῶν.","buckley":"But when they now had reached a place where it appeared fit to lay an ambush, by a river, where was a watering-place for all cattle, there they settled, wrapped in shining brass... Then, having formed a line, they fought a battle on the banks of the river, and wounded one another with their brazen spears. Among them mingled Strife and Tumult, and destructive Fate, holding one freshly-wounded, and another unwounded, and by the feet she dragged another, dead, through the affray; and the garment around her shoulders was crimsoned with the blood of men.","worldModel":{"vision":"Kyanos river watering-place (272/33), bronze scouts in olive reeds, white sheep, charging horses, and Ker in dark-red crimson cloak (320).","memory":"Causal chain: scouts spot herds → ambushers slaughter flocks & piping shepherds → besiegers hear tumult and gallop up → river battle with Eris, Kydoimos, and Ker.","controller":"Acoustic deception (syrinx pipes vs. battle tumult) and mortal vulnerability."}}

